    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφῐοῦσσα</span></b> , 
			contr.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφιόεσσα</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσος</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Serpent-island</i>, a name of Cythnos, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				522
			</span></i>; of Rhodes, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; of an island SW. of Majorca, <i><span class="en">
