				3.5.1
			</span></i>; of various islands, St.Byz.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βέσβικος</span>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a magical
			plant, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				24.163
			</span></i>.</div>
